            "icon_size": 44,
            "icon_background_size": 60,
            "text": "About This Set",
            "color_title": "#406049",
            "text_description": "Serene and quietly luxurious, Monet's Garden draws from the bloom of a French impressionist garden. Lily-pad dots, bamboo-suit stems, soft florals, and delicate hummingbirds create a painterly set, finished with dragonfly Jokers for an artful sense of occasion.",
